   "Q5_Strengths": "I absolutely love working with the Digital HUB team! We collaborate almost weekly on a wide range of marketing activities, from newsletters and customer journeys to website updates, content creation, and many other initiatives.\n\nThe team consistently demonstrates a high level of professionalism, expertise, creativity, and commitment. What I particularly appreciate is their collaborative mindset, responsiveness, flexibility, and genuine willingness to support and find the best solutions.\n\nIt is a real pleasure to work with such a strong, dedicated, and proactive team. Digital HUB is a great example of what effective cross-functional collaboration should look like, and I truly value the partnership.",
   "Q5_Improvements": "While the Digital HUB team is already doing a fantastic job, one opportunity for improvement would be to further expand the team's capacity. Given the growing number of requests and initiatives, having additional resources would help ensure even stronger support across projects, particularly for PWR-related activities and content preparation.\n\nThis would allow the team to provide more dedicated support, take on additional initiatives, and further enhance the quality and efficiency of collaboration, while maintaining the excellent level of service they already deliver.",
